# Root .gitattributes — LF line endings for all testdata fixtures and source files
#
# Go test fixtures are compared byte-for-byte or with LF-expecting parsers,
# so they must not be converted to CRLF on Windows checkout. These blanket
# rules supersede the per-directory .gitattributes files that were added
# reactively in individual tools.
#
# The broader *.md rule also covers non-testdata markdown files (e.g., design
# documents, protocol sources) that are embedded verbatim into deployment
# transform outputs. Keeping all markdown as LF ensures transform outputs are
# deterministic across platforms.

*.md text eol=lf
**/testdata/**/*.golden.txt text eol=lf
**/testdata/**/*.sh text eol=lf
